  dir_optimize_err_retired.pcpp - break step of dir_optimize.pcpp: a retired
  spelling of a level (release_fast is now fast; the report names the new one)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\dir_optimize_err_retired.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\dir_optimize_err_retired.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe dir_optimize_err_retired;
@optimize release_fast; // ERROR SM0100@11: 'release_fast' is no longer a value of @optimize: write 'fast'

begin
end.
